:$PATH\"` is now redundant. Pull the latest `nousresearch/hermes-agent:latest` (or rebuild with the updated base tag) and the PATH mismatch should disappear.\n\nRelated closed issues: #9792, #18673, #13739.\n\nPlease confirm whether pulling the latest image resolves the issue so we can close this out.\n", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4826634676/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4830677068", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/12541#issuecomment-4830677068", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/12541", "id": 4830677068, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G88AAAABH-5ITA", "user": {"login": "konsisumer", "id": 11262660, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjExMjYyNjYw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11262660?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/konsisumer", "html_url": "https://github.com/konsisumer", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/konsisumer/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/konsisumer/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/konsisumer/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/konsisumer/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/konsisumer/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/konsisumer/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/konsisumer/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/konsisumer/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/konsisumer/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-06-29T08:57:17Z", "updated_at": "2026-06-29T08:57:17Z", "body": "These issues look like facets of **one underlying problem**: #12541, #17144, #34026, #35059, #41683, #41699.\n\nThey were grouped by a semantic pass as different symptoms of one underlying problem in `area/docker`. A single coordinated fix may resolve them together \u2014 flagging for visibility; no action has been taken on the individual issues.\n\n_Automated root-cause grouping. Reply to correct if these are unrelated._\n\n<!-- autocontrib:worker-id=root-cause kind=root-cause-triage -->", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4830677068/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4865587667", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/12541#issuecomment-4865587667", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/12541", "id": 4865587667, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G88AAAABIgL50w", "user": {"login": "izumi0uu", "id": 140379130, "node_id": "U_kgDOCF4D-g", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140379130?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/izumi0uu", "html_url": "https://github.com/izumi0uu", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/izumi0uu/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/izumi0uu/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/izumi0uu/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/izumi0uu/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/izumi0uu/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/izumi0uu/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/izumi0uu/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/izumi0uu/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/izumi0uu/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-07-02T12:18:25Z", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T12:18:25Z", "body": "Closing as already fixed on current Docker image/mainline. The base image now includes /opt/hermes/.venv/bin in PATH and the /opt/hermes/bin/hermes shim from the s6-overlay migration path; this matches the maintainer note above. Please reopen with a fresh latest-image repro if the PATH mismatch still occurs.", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4865587667/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4951602539", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/12541#issuecomment-4951602539", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/12541", "id": 4951602539, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G88AAAABJyN1aw", "user": {"login": "teknium1", "id": 127238744, "node_id": "U_kgDOB5WCWA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127238744?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1", "html_url": "https://github.com/teknium1", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-07-12T14:50:01Z", "updated_at": "2026-07-12T14:50:01Z", "body": "<!-- hermes-sweeper:item=12541 -->\n<!-- hermes-sweeper:verdict=close reason=implemented_on_main confidence=high -->\nThis is an automated hermes-sweeper review. The reported Docker PATH mismatch is implemented on current `main`.\n\n- `Dockerfile:334` now sets `PATH=\"/opt/hermes/bin:/opt/hermes/.venv/bin:/opt/data/.local/bin:${PATH}\"`, so the Hermes virtualenv is available without shell activation.\n- Commit `aeb992d34374bf07f34811a3e8a11e623d1cc16b` (`fix(docker): drop docker exec to hermes uid before invoking the CLI`) introduced that PATH ordering and the Docker-exec shim; it is present in current `main`.\n- `docker/hermes-exec-shim.sh:52-87` executes the real `/opt/hermes/.venv/bin/hermes` binary for the hermes user and drops root `docker exec` calls to that user.\n- This matches the June 28 and July 2 discussion notes. Reopen with a fresh repro against an image built from current main if the behavior persists.\n", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4951602539/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}]